  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Individual Measure to Strengthen Integrated Border Management Capacities in Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action aims to directly respond to the objectives of the Action Document for Individual Measures to strengthen border management capacities in the Western Balkans. IOM aims to contribute to the following objective: to improve Integrated Border Management (IBM) in line with the human rights of migrants in Montenegro. This project specifically aims to contribute to the Montenegro IBM Strategy and Schengen Action Plan in areas of border security, migrant identification and registration, information management, and overall human-rights compliant management of the blue and green borders. It furthermore aims to contribute to Montenegro&#x2019;s progress in resolving gaps identified in the European Commissions&#x2019; Montenegro Report 2021, which identifies the need to &#x201C;further strengthen the capacities in border management, by addressing the critical gaps in human resources and equipment</narrative>
  </description>
